  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients except NaHCO3, Trace vitamins, Na2S・9H2O and cysteine・HCl・H2O, and autoclave under a N2--CO2 (80:20) atmosphere. Filter--sterilize NaHCO3 as an 8% solution and Trace vitamins while gassing with N2. Separately autoclave Na2S・9H2O and cysteine・HCl・H2O as 5% solutions under a N2 atmosphere. Aseptically and anaerobically add NaHCO3 and Trace vitamins to the medium under a N2--CO2 (80:20) atmosphere. Prior to inoculation, add the sterile Na2S・9H2O and cysteine・HCl・H2O solutions, and adjust pH to 6.8."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "Adjust pH to 7.0 with 1 N KOH."
    }
  ]
}